From: panvk-kbase-android worker <panvk-worker@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH wsi 016] panvk: Android VK_KHR_android_surface + AHB swapchain

Purpose: Advertise VK_KHR_android_surface, implement
 panvk_CreateAndroidSurfaceKHR, register an Android wsi_interface, and
 create AHB-backed swapchain images with acquire/present. Present copies
 GPU-written AHB pixels into ANativeWindow (lock/unlockAndPost). Do not
 CPU-fill the window. wsi_swapchain_init is not used (NULL image_params
 would crash get_blit_type). Acquire semaphore is signaled by common WSI
 dummy sync; driver acquire only rotates the image index.
Source/Reference: G615 beta.2 P6-P8.
Tested GPU: Poco X6 Pro / G615.
Tested Kbase UAPI: CSF 1.21.
Mesa base range: 26.3.0-devel (pinned 5a07217f).
Dependencies: kbase-common/006, android/015.
Validation test: loader APK Gate H vkCreateAndroidSurfaceKHR + 300 present.

